LICENSE — not yet finalized.

This project's final license depends on the license of whichever Saturn
CPU emulation core ends up vendored (see CLAUDE.md's "The Saturn CPU
core" section), plus the confirmed LGPL-2.1 terms of the vendored-by-copy
`sharpdisp/` display library. Soynut (this project's structural template)
adopted GPL-2.0-or-later specifically to match its own vendored core's
exact terms, since its firmware statically links that core's code into
one binary — Mercator will need the same kind of deliberate choice once
its own core's real license is confirmed by reading its actual source,
not before.

This placeholder grants no rights and should not be treated as a real
license. Do not redistribute this repository's contents relying on this
file.
